- Allows users to create a list of grocery items 
- Users may add 
  - manually - auto-complete
  - photo of a list
  - upload a file list
- edit the list
- share the list (whatsapp, copy the link, copy the text, email)
  - share list is a categorized checklist with details (qty, etc)
- list is categorized for easy shopping
- completed (bought items) can be added to the pantry
- users can see what items are going to be used for (recipe it is needed)
